{"title":"2016 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Interactive_Teaching_Approach)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d674023a1aeeb093498a81cce51a90a0abf07db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a^{-1}+\\frac{a^{-1}}{2}}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"44\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a9d49204d0db99d687e764f3caa877aca867db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a= \\tfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"43\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/4/034b1747cb6012c30926ce531a4431e2ae586fca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"370\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factorizing the numerator, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f807516bf1e77ef0503c8dd0b1ac46364ea2597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{a}\\cdot(2+\\frac{1}{2})}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" /> then becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d81eadc4f20c12f7b646ec3be41ad5938621aac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{5}{2}}{a^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"19\" height=\"40\" /> which is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a90f03c5595047822a09ac0ca8083e939558d42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot 2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"41\" height=\"37\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c2b4e1927beecd6f76ddf7eabf239a21f2eb38a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f807516bf1e77ef0503c8dd0b1ac46364ea2597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{a}\\cdot(2+\\frac{1}{2})}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c2b4e1927beecd6f76ddf7eabf239a21f2eb38a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>Remember, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f5ebbb5761fcb9d76f4558848e12f453e39fa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{-y}=\\frac{1}{x^y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" />!\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Interactive_Teaching_Approach.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Interactive_Teaching_Approach)\">Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bH8Byiqr5WA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bH8Byiqr5WA</a>\n</p><p>~MathkidsbyMax\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2erUXM5pD2g\">https://youtu.be/2erUXM5pD2g</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1IZ3oj1iGf0\">https://youtu.be/1IZ3oj1iGf0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B\" title=\"2016 AMC 10B\">2016 AMC 1